        <Desc>ATHENA'S LIFTING WHILE CLIMBING SUMMITAthena's 3rd Annual Lifting While Climbing Summit offers a transformative experience as we ignite the leadership demands of our global STEM workforce. Whether you're looking to elevate your career, hone your leadership skills, or scale your company through diversity and inclusion, this summit offers access to modern-day leadership, timely workforce needs and the savvy career tactics essential to advance your growth while making a positive impact on the world around you. Join us and embark on a riveting journey of high-growth, limitless possibility, and innovation through equality. Grab your proverbial hiking shoes and join Athenas 3rd Annual Lifting While Climbing Summit on September 18 at San Diego State University's Montezuma Hall, where you can expect to:Assess the full range of career impacts you can make by lifting others in your workplaceIdentify the key steps and targeted behaviors essential to scaling new heights in your STEM careerAdopt the leadership principles and techniques of modern day leaders and alliesDeepen capacity to accelerate inclusive leaders that recognize innovation knows no gender</Desc>
